  "title": "Artificer device feat text describes temporary devices",
  "description": "Found in the live check of #4 (its item 29); still true on master `962463fa6`.\n\nThe artificer feat `FEAT_WEIRD_SCIENCE` (`src/character/feats.c:5862-5867`) says its devices are\ntemporary with a limited number of uses per day. In the code, devices are permanent (the saved\n`duration` field is never read) and regain one use per tick out of combat (`check_device_one()`,\n`src/core/limits.c`). The device help entry already states the real rules.\n\n## Done when\n\n- [ ] The `FEAT_WEIRD_SCIENCE` description matches the device mechanic and the device help entry.\n- [ ] `make -j$(nproc)` passes.",
